<h2 class="bde-heading-506-115 bde-heading">
What Is Grant Nelson’s Salary With the Nets?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-116 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-139 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-151 bde-f-text">
<p>Nelson earns <strong>$678.88k</strong> in 2026-27 on a two-way contract, with <strong>$91k</strong> guaranteed. He’s on identical terms to <a href="/players/tyler-bilodeau/">Tyler Bilodeau</a> and almost identical terms to <a href="/players/chaney-johnson/">Chaney Johnson</a>.</p>
<p>He earned <strong>$73.15k</strong> last season from a single ten-day contract, which is the smallest published figure anywhere on this roster. Two-way pay sits outside <a href="/teams/brooklyn-nets/">Brooklyn</a>‘s <strong>$160.06m</strong> payroll.</p>

