<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
What Are the Terms of Grant Nelson’s Contract?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Nelson signed a one-year two-way contract with Brooklyn on September 4, 2026 worth <strong>$678.88k</strong> with <strong>$91k</strong> guaranteed.</p>
<p>It’s the third contract of his career. The two before it were a camp deal that didn’t convert and a ten-day in February, so this is the first arrangement that covers a whole season.</p>

</div><div class="bde-shortcode-506-191 bde-shortcode"><div class="nba-fin" data-nba-fin="proportions">
