</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Nelson’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$300k</strong>, based on about <strong>$752k</strong> in published career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for a player at this stage.</p>
<p>Almost all of that is this season’s contract. He went undrafted out of Alabama in 2025 after four college seasons, having started at North Dakota State before transferring, so there was no rookie contract to begin with.</p>

