<section id="sources-methodology"><h2>Methodology</h2><details><summary>Methodology &amp; Notes</summary><p>Gross scheduled base pay in USD. Career totals sum completed-season base salaries and are not cash received or net worth. Time figures spread annual pay across 365 days. Cap shares use each season’s league cap. Current payroll shares use the active-roster base total, excluding cap holds. A dash means no comparable payroll total was verified. Upcoming contracted pay is dotted, and player options remain conditional.</p><p><a href="https://www.salaryswish.com/salary-cap">SalarySwish · League Cap History</a></p></details></section><script src="/_ported/8334868131c3.js" is:inline></script>
